      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/terror.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A mothfolk projects an aura of fear around itself in a 20-foot radius. Creatures within this area that wish to remain must attempt a @Check[save:will]{Will save} (DC 10 + ½ the mothman’s Hit Dice + its Charisma modifier) or be affected as by a fear spell. A mothfolk is immune to the fear auras of other mothfolk.</p>",
